  "description": "I transmigrated into my favorite novel — as the doomed villainess Ione! To survive, I must protect my beloved stepson Edwin and play the perfect duchess in a contract marriage. But when it’s time to break the marriage contract, my newfound family won’t let me go. What happens when the villainess is no longer the villain?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
